<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Corpaf share delisting to go ahead.</title>
<headline>Corpaf share delisting to go ahead.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporate Africa Ltd said on Friday all conditions for the delisting of the group's ordinary and preference shares had been fulfilled following a Supreme Court order.</p>
<p>The shares will be delisted from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange from January 17, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
